@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
title RetailBank — новый сегмент: диагностика и контролируемый rollout
actor "Финмониторинг /\nML validation" as owner
participant "Monitoring +\ncoverage registry" as mon
participant "Feature / source\nsnapshots" as data
participant "Offline evaluation" as eval
participant "Signed deployment\nmanifest" as registry
participant "Ranking / Queue" as live
mon -> owner : Новый сегмент / OOD / yield или label lag
owner -> live : Sellers → rules + deadline / age
note right of live
Mandatory review продолжается.
Unknown segment ≠ low risk.
end note
owner -> data : Reconcile schema / units / IDs / available_at
owner -> eval : Audit selection / maturity / guide
data -> eval : Frozen matched cohorts + probability sample
eval -> eval : H1–H8 tests / feature ablations
alt Pipeline / labels defect
 eval --> owner : Причина в данных / оценке
 owner -> data : Исправить source mapping / guide
else Segment behavior shift подтверждён
 eval -> eval : Segment features / normalizer candidate
end
eval -> eval : Old + sellers regression / safety gates
alt Нет доказанного преимущества / gate failure
 eval --> owner : Не продвигать; оставить fallback
else Gates пройдены
 owner -> registry : Approve compatible bundle\nmodel + features + segment + policy
 registry -> live : Shadow без влияния на queue
 live --> mon : Versions / quality / quotas / deadlines
 owner -> registry : Canary 5% → 25% → 100% client-clusters\nтолько после window / evidence gates
 registry -> live : Atomic routing manifest
 opt Guardrail breach / regression
  mon -> owner : Stop / incident evidence
  owner -> registry : Previous compatible bundle\nили deterministic fallback
  registry -> live : Rollback route, invalidate cached scores
  live --> owner : Verify workers / in-flight / queue ordering
 end
end
note over owner, live
Human actions не откатываются; recommendations сохраняют версии.
Raw metrics и новые labels не вызывают auto-promotion.
end note
@enduml
